## Notes on third-party content

Some skills under `skills/` were derived from upstream sources (e.g.,
[oh-my-opencode](https://github.com/code-yeongyu/oh-my-opencode) by
[@code-yeongyu](https://github.com/code-yeongyu)). Where derived,
attribution is preserved in the individual SKILL.md headers. Those
upstream sources are themselves MIT-or-similar permissive — the
re-licensing under MIT here is consistent with their terms.

For test-only third-party libraries (`pytest`, `jsonschema`, `PyYAML`),
see the relevant project's own license terms (all MIT or BSD).
